From 98dc0eed5eadf847d236e92e8061258382e01404 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: starbite <starbite@local>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:36:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] port: rebase board MASTER configs on xnu-11417

MASTER.arm64.{sweet,a5xelte,herolte,starlte} were full copies of
xnu-8796's MASTER.arm64.MacOSX. Three-way merged onto 11417's MacOSX
config (base = 8796 MacOSX): same board delta (KERNEL_BASE with
nos_arm_asm nos_arm_pmap and no SPTM block; FILESYS_BASE with mockfs,
sweet_hfs, bindfs, without config_ext_resolver). CPU_COUNTERS_BASE is
empty as on virtualized SoCs: 11417's real osfmk/arm64/kpc.c programs
Apple's PMU (the 8796 configs used a stub kpc.c instead).
---
 config/MASTER.arm64.a5xelte | 60 ++++++++++++++++++++++---------------
 config/MASTER.arm64.herolte | 60 ++++++++++++++++++++++---------------
 config/MASTER.arm64.starlte | 60 ++++++++++++++++++++++---------------
 config/MASTER.arm64.sweet   | 60 ++++++++++++++++++++++---------------
 4 files changed, 144 insertions(+), 96 deletions(-)

